    "Reinforcement is easy to spot: both sides value security, loyalty and the long view, so this combination rarely gambles what it has built. Earth and water also blend well, the one giving shape to the other. The complexity comes from Cancer's moods meeting the Ox's stoicism. Feelings that the Crab would naturally voice can be pressed down by the Ox's instinct to keep working and say nothing, which may surface later as stubbornness or a sudden withdrawal. That is not a flaw so much as a signal worth noticing. It can help to build a small, regular outlet for emotion, such as a weekly walk with a trusted friend or a journal kept by the bed. Consider letting one routine change each season, so steadiness stays a choice.",
