    "Both sides prize sincerity, comfort and close bonds, so this pairing is often wonderful company and a dependable friend in hard times. Shared Yin also gives them patience and a gentle way of listening. The pull in different directions is subtle. The Pig trusts easily, while Cancer's shell exists precisely because it has been hurt before, so this person may swing between open-hearted giving and sudden self-protection after a disappointment. Both responses are valid; the work is finding a middle setting. It can help to set clear, kindly expressed limits on what they give, especially to people who rarely give back. Consider tending their own needs with the care they lavish on others, perhaps by keeping one evening a week free of hosting entirely.",
