    "Ambition, sociability and confidence appear in both systems, and both are Yang, so this person usually has energy to spare and little fear of being noticed. That makes them effective in roles that mix performance with planning. The complexity comes from fire meeting water. Leo wants to be generous and grand, while the Rat is careful with resources and keeps an eye on the exits, so this person can oscillate between lavish gestures and sudden thrift. Both instincts have value. It can help to decide in advance where generosity matters most, then allow full Leo warmth there and Rat caution elsewhere. Consider also checking motives occasionally; when charm starts to feel like a tool rather than a gift, it may be time to slow down and simply enjoy people.",
